gitdock (1.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Robust parsing of gh auth status with fallback for older gh CLI versions.
  * Fix scan-repos path duplication and double listing bug.
  * Support POST and PUT on workspace activation to prevent HTML fallback 404.
  * Reload page on successful workspace switch.
  * Use trimEnd instead of trim to preserve first-line leading spaces in git porcelain status.

 -- GitDock Dev <dev@gitdock.dev>  Thu, 23 Jul 2026 12:00:00 +0000

gitdock (1.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian package.
  * Systemd service integration.
  * Multi-account GitHub and GitLab support.
  * Provider-aware workspace directory structure.

 -- GitDock Dev <dev@gitdock.dev>  Thu, 17 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000
